---
description: Conventional commits and lint-staged expectations
globs: "*"
alwaysApply: true
---

# commits

- Format: `type(scope): subject` — Commitlint enforced.
- Types: `feat`, `fix`, `refactor`, `docs`, `test`, `chore`, `perf`, `ci`, `build`, `style`, `revert`.
- Scope: kebab-case (Nx project name preferred, e.g. `feature-users`, `core-domain`).
- Subject: imperative, ≤100 char header; no Sentence case / PascalCase.
- Pre-commit runs lint-staged (ESLint, Stylelint, Prettier) — fix, do not skip hooks.
- Do not commit `.env.local` or secrets.
